              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
		-->

    <!-- Educational Talks & Media Section -->
    <section id="talks" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-16">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[rgb(74,168,218)]/10 text-[rgb(74,168,218)] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            <span>Education & Outreach</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            Spreading Environmental Awareness
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base">
            Knowledge is the foundation of change. We deliver engaging presentations and share thought-provoking content across our digital channels.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          
          <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="p-3 w-fit rounded-xl bg-[rgb(74,168,218)]/10 text-[rgb(74,168,218)]">
                <Presentation class="w-6 h-6" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Book a Sustainability Talk</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Looking for an engaging speaker for your school, college, or local group? We offer tailored sessions covering practical environmental actions, carbon footprint reduction, and e-waste management.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a href="#get-involved" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[rgb(74,168,218)] hover:underline">
              <span>Schedule a Speaker</span>
              <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="p-3 w-fit rounded-xl bg-[rgb(119,230,128)]/20 text-slate-900">
                <Video class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-700" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Follow Our Video Series</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Catch our short video clips breaking down complex environmental news, sharing inspiring quotes from climate pioneers, and demonstrating step-by-step DIY tech repairs.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a href="#get-involved" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:underline">
              <span>Connect for Video Updates</span>
              <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Latest Posts Section -->
    <section id="posts" class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-16">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[rgb(74,168,218)]/10 text-[rgb(74,168,218)] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            <span>Community Updates & Posts</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            Latest Posts & Highlights
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base">
            Notes, discussions, and event updates from our ongoing work raising sustainability awareness across the community.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Post Cards Container -->
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-12">
          
          <!-- Post Card 1: Smarter AI Summit 2026 -->
          <article class="bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md">
            
            <!-- Post Header / Metadata -->
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 pb-4 sm:pb-6 border-b border-slate-200/80 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[rgb(74,168,218)]/15 border border-[rgb(74,168,218)]/30 flex items-center justify-center p-1.5">
                  <img src="/img/sl.png" alt="Sustainability Loft" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm sm:text-base">Sustainability Loft</span>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[rgb(119,230,128)]/20 text-emerald-800 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide">
                      Update
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                      <MapPin class="w-3 h-3 text-[rgb(74,168,218)]" />
                      <span>Bournemouth University</span>
                    </span>
                    <span>&bull;</span>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                      <Calendar class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-600" />
                      <span>Smarter AI Summit 2026</span>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[rgb(119,230,128)]"></span>
                <span>AI & Talent Pathways</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Post Content -->
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
              
              <!-- Post Body Copy -->
              <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
                <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">
                  ✨️ Brilliant to have attended the Smarter AI and Responsible Technology Summit 2026, at Bournemouth University yesterday. The event focused on how organisations can harness the opportunities presented by AI and digital transformation.
                </p>
                <p>
                  💡 Participating in the panel discussion about 'Building your talent pipeline in the age of AI' was particularly rewarding as this topic is so closely aligned to our mission to raise awareness about sustainability and associated career pathways for young people.
                </p>
                <p>
                  🫱🏻‍🫲🏼 If you're interested in exploring a collaboration or partnership about raising sustainability awareness amongst younger people in the Bournemouth area, please get in touch.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Media Showcase (3-image responsive grid) -->
              <div class="pt-2">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
                  
                  <!-- Left main photo: Panel portrait view -->
                  <div class="md:col-span-5 relative group cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 h-80 sm:h-96 md:h-[460px] post-image-trigger" data-img="/img/sl-posts/smarter-ai/smarter-ai-1.jpg" data-caption="Panel Discussion: Building Your Talent Pipeline in the Age of AI — Bournemouth University Summit 2026">
                    <img
                      src="/img/sl-posts/smarter-ai/smarter-ai-1.jpg"
                      alt="Panel discussion on building future workforce in the age of AI at Bournemouth University"
                      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
